<title>CROATIA: Croatia May unemployment falls to 16.3 vs 16.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatia May unemployment falls to 16.3 vs 16.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following unemployment details.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	   MAY	  APRIL	 MAY 96</p>
<p> Total unemployed	     274,521     282,020     256,645</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     16.3	  16.6	  18.1</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude unemployed in Serb region of Eastern Slavonia. The unemployment rate fell to under 16 percent in September 1996 after army, police and farmers were included in total workforce, but joblessness increased since then. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
